title: Authorizations › Eligibility & Benefits › Create an authorization from a verification
route: /authorizations/eligibility/R-1042
intro: A coverage check often ends with "now we need an authorization". Two buttons on the result carry the stored verification to New case, so nothing is typed twice: 'Start authorization' (the type is Initial) and 'Create authorization from verification' (the type is still to choose).
dir: TD
also: Demo only: nothing is sent to a payer. New case reads the stored verification and shows it in step 2 with 'Last verified' and 'Refresh verification'.
---
start s1 "On a result, read the buttons on the verdict band"
decision q1 "Is the verdict 'Authorization first'?"
click c1 "Click 'Start authorization'"
process p1 "Opens /authorizations/new?verification=R-1042&type=initial\nAuthorization type is already Initial"
click c2 "Click 'Create authorization from verification'\n(on every result, whatever the verdict)"
process p2 "Opens /authorizations/new?verification=R-1042\nThe authorization type is still to be chosen"
process p3 "New case reads the stored verification\nPatient (initials, age), payer, program, member (masked), dates of service\nand the check itself, with its warnings"
decision q2 "Is the verification still fresh, 24 demo hours or less?"
process p4 "Step 2 shows it as the verification for this case\n'Last verified Tue 10:44 am, 2 min ago. Simulated source.'"
process p5 "Step 2 offers 'Refresh verification' before going on"
decision q3 "Is the check at a site the viewer can see?"
screen o1 "A notice: not available at this site\nNothing is carried over"
screen sc "New case\nAuthorization type, the five steps"
goto g1 "Continues in: Authorizations › New case › How a case starts and resumes"
goto g2 "Continues in: Authorizations › Eligibility & Benefits › The shared verification record"
goto g3 "Continues in: Authorizations › Eligibility & Benefits › Result › Next actions"

s1 --> q1
q1 -->|Yes| c1 --> p1 --> q3
q1 -->|No| c2
c2 --> p2 --> q3
q3 -->|No| o1
q3 -->|Yes| p3 --> q2
q2 -->|Yes| p4 --> sc
q2 -->|No| p5 --> sc
sc --> g1
p3 -.-> g2
s1 -.-> g3
